  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Applied research and training program with Nasa indigenous communities in the municipalities of Jambal and Caldono</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centro Nacional de Consultora (CNC) will conduct an applied research and training program with Nasa communities in the municipalities of Jambal and Caldono in the department of Cauca. The program will generate base line information on households and rural production through the implementation of a survey that will validate a new set of indicators, which will contribute towards the measurement of quality of life of indigenous communities. The project will directly benefit 135 persons and indirectly benefit 10,000 indigenous people.</narrative>
  </description>
